    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow and Crossbreed Your Own Vegetables.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise crops while experimenting with soil and compost,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and create brand-new varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of vegetables will you grow? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/e1536d1a61a887f6e9cbcf051e3b1df6.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Skills in the Vegetable Contest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with rivals and aim for victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with vegetables that match the theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/4039a9cadd3e9bc595e109354975e87d.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Sales or Wholesale\u2014How Will You Sell?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put in the effort to earn higher prices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or ship in bulk for efficiency?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/66b0c42b00ca0812e74c5805f1c82af8.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own carefully cultivated vegetables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and create special varieties that are uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/ce5a152586872f069fd0a5ac10911e24.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=627 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grow and Crossbreed Your Own Vegetables.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise crops while experimenting with soil and compost,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and create brand-new varieties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What kind of vegetables will you grow? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/e1536d1a61a887f6e9cbcf051e3b1df6.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Test Your Skills in the Vegetable Contest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with rivals and aim for victory</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >with vegetables that match the theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/4039a9cadd3e9bc595e109354975e87d.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Direct Sales or Wholesale\u2014How Will You Sell?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put in the effort to earn higher prices,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or ship in bulk for efficiency?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/66b0c42b00ca0812e74c5805f1c82af8.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=452 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own carefully cultivated vegetables</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and create special varieties that are uniquely yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609130/extras/ce5a152586872f069fd0a5ac10911e24.avif?t=1744610349\" data-has-big width=800 height=627 /></span></p>",
